        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/RIN1.html"
      },
      "type": "CHAR"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "不含税行金额（本币）",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "LineTotal",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "不含税本币行金额，币种取同一公司库 OADM.MainCurncy；不随行 Currency 或表头 DocCur 改变币种口径。不等同库存估价过账金额，也不能忽略税费、折扣和舍入差异直接等同单据头总额。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/RIN1.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "无库存数量变动标志",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "NoInvtryMv",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "应收贷项行的无数量过账标志；Y 表示该行不改变库存数量。贷项可能仅调整金额而没有实物退货，不能把所有贷项 Quantity 当作实际退货量；仍须结合来源单据及业务条件判断库存和会计影响。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/RIN1.html"
      },
      "type": "VARCHAR"
    },
