      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "以库存单位表示的未结数量；用于与库存口径比较，仍属当前状态。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/RIN1.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "未结单据单位数量",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "OpenQty",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "当前剩余未结数量；不是任意历史时点余额，也不能普遍等同未发货或未开票数量。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/RIN1.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "税前单价",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "Price",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "DI API 将 Price 定义为税前单价；本表数据库参考只标为价格，折后含义须结合 PriceBefDi、DiscPrcnt 及定价规则解释，不能声称本表字典已直接注明。 价格币种取本行 Currency，按本行交易计价单位解释；结合 UomEntry/UomCode/unitMsr、UseBaseUn 和 NumPerMsr 核对，不默认按库存单位计价。 不直接相加作为业务金额，也不能当作库存估值单价。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/RIN1.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "行折后含税单价",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "PriceAfVAT",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "应用本行折扣后的含税单价，不是折前含税价。 价格币种取本行 Currency，按本行交易计价单位解释；结合 UomEntry/UomCode/unitMsr、UseBaseUn 和 NumPerMsr 核对，不默认按库存单位计价。 与税前价、折前价及行金额分别使用，不以当前税率和折扣重算覆盖历史值。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/RIN1.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
      "displayName": "行折前税前单价",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "PriceBefDi",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "应用本行折扣前的税前单价；本表列定义与 SAP 单位价格规则共同确定该口径。 价格币种取本行 Currency，按本行交易计价单位解释；结合 UomEntry/UomCode/unitMsr、UseBaseUn 和 NumPerMsr 核对，不默认按库存单位计价。 与折后价格及已保存行金额分别使用。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKHelp/RIN1.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL"
    },
    {
